{% extends "quarterly_deep_dive/llm_prompts/base_prompt.j2" %}

{# Specific context for the second callout in Section 4 #}
{% set output_format_description = "a brief callout (1-2 sentences) highlighting a second, distinct, impactful insight regarding CVSS scores from the Section 4 data/insights provided, suitable for a distinct callout box" %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Review the data summaries and chart insights provided below for "{{ section_title }}". This section focuses on CVSS score distributions.
Following the general instructions, identify a *second, distinct* significant finding related to CVSS scores (different from Callout 1). Perhaps focus on a lower-scoring but frequent category, a comparison between two categories, or the implication of the overall score range observed.
Craft a concise callout (1-2 sentences maximum) stating this key finding clearly.
{% endblock task_instructions %}

{% block data_context %}
Section Key: {{ data_context_payload.section_key | default('section_4_cvss_dist') }}

Insights Generated for Charts in this Section:
{% for chart_id, insight in data_context_payload.chart_insights_in_section.items() %}
- Insight for {{ chart_id }}: {{ insight }}
{% else %}
- No specific chart insights provided for this section.
{% endfor %}

Data Summaries for Charts in this Section:
{% for chart_id, summary in data_context_payload.charts_data_summaries_in_section.items() %}
--- Data Summary: {{ chart_id }} ---
{{ summary }}
--- End Summary ---
{% else %}
- No chart data summaries provided.
{% endfor %}
{% endblock data_context %}
